  "content": "<p>The SO-101 Robot Arm is an open-source project for learning AI-driven robotics and manipulation tasks.</p><p>One of our members started by ordering the motors and printing the model and soon other members followed to build their own. The first robot arm is already being tuned with trained data to pick up cubes automatically, though there are still some issues to solve. </p><p>Our robots and drones meetup works on projects like this regularly. Check munichmakerlab.de/events for dates.</p>",
